00:04:41.553 --> 00:04:46.297
<v Maya>systemic discrimination. They introduced this idea of an iterated audit.</v>

44
00:04:46.677 --> 00:04:47.318
<v Daniel>Okay. What does that mean?</v>

45
00:04:47.871 --> 00:04:57.036
<v Maya>Well, in one of their experiments, they proved that when large language models wrote recommendation letters for STEM candidates, the AI embedded gendered language into the text.</v>

46
