65
00:06:54.510 --> 00:07:05.981
<v Maya>Yeah. Imagine a massive, multidimensional map of human language. Over billions of pages of internet data, words that frequently appear together are placed closer together on this map.</v>

66
00:07:06.181 --> 00:07:06.982
<v Daniel>Okay. That makes sense.</v>

67
00:07:07.437 --> 00:07:22.156
<v Maya>So mathematically, words related to agreeable or team player or communication skills are clustered slightly closer to the concept of woman in the AI's training data. When prompted to write for a woman, the algorithm naturally</v>

