72
00:07:39.206 --> 00:07:53.757
<v Maya>The researchers asked that exact question. They tested it by comparing the AI-generated CVs to real-world Glassdoor job descriptions. And? And the data shows that, yes, the AI is matching reality, but it's matching existing occupational</v>

